		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Vaguely intelligent plant life. Broad, veridian, toothy leaf with a short, hollow-tubed tail for implanting seeds.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 5, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +0 (1 + poison) or implant, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Implant</strong>. 1/day, Insert seed inside helpless mortal. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, spawning a leaf ray which bursts from the corpse.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 9+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
